		],
		"en": [
			"For GUNPLA fans around the world, this is a limited edition GUNPLA at the official GUNPLA complex \"GUNDAM Base\". Real Grade Sinanju is now available in a GUNDAM base limited metallic gloss injection. The characteristic red fuselage color is reproduced with glossy gloss injection."
